{"id": "UgzwL7vyAiiDilTrLQJ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 1, "text": "I don't often come across people who look beyond the importance of money, so your title, \"What's More Important Than Money?\" immediately caught my attention 😊\n\nI really liked that you talked about your mindset towards money and being more mindful of how you spend it. It was such a refreshing change from all the content that's focused on earning more.\n\nI also have trouble with being consistent, especially when it comes to studying, so I could definitely relate 😆 But I'm glad you pointed out that finding enjoyment in learning matters, rather than just studying for the sake of it.\n\nThanks for being so open about your struggles and sharing what's been helping you. It was genuinely encouraging to watch, and I'll definitely be checking out more of your videos! 😊✨", "published": "2026-07-28T17:53:26", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgzwL7vyAiiDilTrLQJ4AaABAg.AZoccYkXpvuAZqezqyc2Xg", "parent": "UgzwL7vyAiiDilTrLQJ4AaABAg", "likes": 1, "text": "Thank you so much for your thoughtful comment😊\nI’m really happy that the message reached you\nI’m still learning little by little too, so let’s keep growing together\nThank you for subscribing and for your kind encouragement🫶🏻", "published": "2026-07-29T12:52:34", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
